@startuml Banking Chatbot Service

title Banking Chatbot Service Architecture

' Styling
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam ArrowColor 00338D
skinparam BorderColor 00338D
skinparam noteBackgroundColor 0091DA
skinparam noteFontColor White

' Actors
actor User

' Core Components
[Gemma 3.0 27B] as chatbot
note bottom of chatbot: Multimodal LLM Architecture\nSingle-GPU Deployment
[Frontend] as frontend
[Gemma 3.0 1B] as smallLLM
note bottom of smallLLM: Embedding Generation Model\nOptimized for RAG Query Processing

[Service Layer] as svc
note top of svc: Performs sentiment analysis\n and intent recognition\nto facilitate menu navigation\n and customer service routing \n verifies LLM output for compliance

' External Services
cloud {
database "Vector Database" as vdb

}

' Flow - Updated sequence
User --> frontend: Sends query
frontend --> svc: User input
svc --> smallLLM: Processed query
smallLLM --> vdb: Search vectors
vdb --> chatbot: Knowledge context
chatbot --> svc: Raw response
svc --> frontend: Processed response


@enduml

@startuml Personalized Banking Offers

title Personalized Banking Offers System

' Styling
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam ArrowColor 00338D
skinparam BorderColor 00338D
skinparam noteBackgroundColor 0091DA
skinparam noteFontColor White

' Actors
actor User
actor "Bank Employee" as employee

' Core Components
[Offer Model] as offerModel
note bottom of offerModel: AI-based recommendation engine\nGenerates personalized offers

[Fine Tuner] as fineTuner
note left of fineTuner: Periodically updates model\nfrom customer response data

[Validation Engine] as validationEngine
note right of validationEngine: Rule-based verification system\nChecks compliance and eligibility\n(Non-AI component)

[Offer System] as offerSystem
note right of offerSystem: Internal management interface\nfor offer parameters and rules

[Frontend] as frontend
[Backend] as backend
[Data Cleaner] as dataCleaner
note bottom of dataCleaner: Processes customer response data\nfor analytics and storage

' Databases
database "Offer DB" as offerDB

database "Validation DB" as validationDB

' Flow - Offer Generation
offerDB --> offerModel: Customer analytics
offerDB --> fineTuner: Training data
fineTuner --> offerModel: Model updates
offerModel --> validationEngine: Generated offers
validationEngine --> validationDB
validationDB --> validationEngine: Compliance check

' Flow - Validated Offers to Customer
validationEngine --> frontend: Validated offers
frontend --> User: Offers

' Flow - Employee Management (Internal)
employee --> offerSystem: Edit offer parameters
offerSystem --> validationEngine: Updated rules
offerSystem --> validationDB: Edit validation rules

' Flow - Customer Response
User --> frontend
frontend --> backend: Response data
backend --> dataCleaner: Raw response data
dataCleaner --> offerDB

@enduml

@startuml Fraud Detection System

title Banking Fraud Detection System

' Styling
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam ArrowColor 00338D
skinparam BorderColor 00338D
skinparam noteBackgroundColor 0091DA
skinparam noteFontColor White

' Actors
actor User
actor "Fraud Analyst" as analyst

' Core Components
[Transaction Processor] as processor
[Autoencoder Model] as autoencoder
note bottom of autoencoder: Deep learning model trained\nto extract features from\nnormal and fraudulent transactions
[Fine Tuner] as fineTuner
note left of fineTuner: Periodically retrains\nthe autoencoder model\nwith new transaction data
[Scoring Engine] as scoring
note right of scoring: Places transactions on\na fraud distribution using\nweighted feature approach
[Alert System] as alert
[Manual Review Interface] as review
note top of review: For transactions requiring\nhuman investigation

' Databases
database "Transaction DB" as transactionDB
note top of transactionDB: Historical legitimate\ntransactions
database "Fraud DB" as fraudDB

' Flow - Transaction Processing
User --> processor: Makes transaction
processor --> transactionDB: Log transaction
autoencoder --> scoring: Extracted features
scoring --> alert: Position on fraud distribution

' Flow - Alert Handling
alert --> processor
alert --> review
review --> analyst: Notification
analyst --> review: Investigation
review --> processor: Decision (Allow/Block)

' Training Flow
transactionDB --> fineTuner: Legitimate transactions
fraudDB --> fineTuner: Fraud patterns
fineTuner --> autoencoder: Model updates

@enduml
